    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Us!</h2>Jox Studio is a newly established game studio based in Canada, focusing on story-driven &amp; narrative games. <br>Our next WIP game will be an interactive fiction game, with Steam store page coming soon.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game:</h2>A short story-driven psychological horror game. <br>As a lost traveler, find out what happened to the previous owners of this abandoned house.<br>The story is inspired by the 1994 novel &quot;The Memory Police&quot; by Yoko Ogawa.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Short duration (30-40 minutes).<br></li><li>Psychological Horror.<br></li><li>No visual jumpscares. <br></li><li>A good story worthy of a read.</li></ul>",
